              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Farao ninye, “Shomo tung'uayioki, toduaa kewan miking'il ae kata adol enkomom ai; amu ore akenya enkolong nidol enkomom ai niye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
